id: monster-form-unstoppable-monster
name: Unstoppable Monster
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 2
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1, 2
# (1) Armored.
aspects: +Armored
description: >
  Thanks to your total mastery over your monstrous self, you've become impossible to defeat.
text: >
  Unstoppable Monster (2): Thanks to your total mastery over your monstrous self, you've become impossible to defeat.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Monster Form gains the Armored Aspect.
  (2)-[Permanent, Passive]: Upon gaining access to this Mastery Trait, select and gain access to a Monstrous Trait while in this Transformation.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you are knocked through a Health Threshold and succeed at the Steadfast Check, apply Legend Realized. This use of Legend Realized does not count towards the amount of uses you gain through the Realization Aspect.

---

# (2) A Monstrous Trait more, (3) Legend Realized: the table's.
